          "text": "The strongest correction from the grilling is this: the proposal was still pretending compaction could be fixed by adding one rendered string beside the old semantic ledger. That preserves two reconstruction paths. I’m deleting that design and making `replacementHistory` the single stored replay artifact for the compacted prefix.",
